message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Steel Frame Seismic Response Dataset"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-21"
abstract: "An OpenSees-generated numerical dataset for machine-learning-based seismic response prediction of five-story steel frame structures. The dataset contains 2,000 valid nonlinear time-history analysis samples under EI and Northridge ground motions. Input variables include story stiffness, story yield shear force, floor mass, story height, damping ratio, and post-yield stiffness ratio. Output variables include maximum roof displacement, maximum interstory drift ratio, and maximum base shear."
authors:
